Column 0 keeps its shape (`IconColumnWidth`, `SizingFixed`), so nothing moves: required columns
are the dot (2+2) and Name (16+2) = 22 ≤ 58 at 60 columns; Tags, Source, Ref, Synced are
`Optional` and drop as today. No threshold to recalibrate. Q1-B adds no width (7 < 10).

